KanjiVG stroke data
-------------------

The kanji stroke-order data used by the "漢字かきとり" (kanji-writer) game is
derived from KanjiVG.

  - Project: KanjiVG — https://kanjivg.tagaini.net
  - Copyright (C) Ulrich Apel and the KanjiVG contributors
  - License: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported
    (CC BY-SA 3.0) — https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/

The file `quiz/stroke/kanji_strokes.ts` is generated by
`tools/gen_kanji_strokes.ts`, which simplifies each KanjiVG stroke into one of
eight swipe directions. Because it is a derivative of KanjiVG, this generated
direction data is likewise distributed under CC BY-SA 3.0. The generator
script and the game code around it remain under the project's MIT License.
